        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>                      The circus welcomes everyone… but not everyone leaves.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circus of Pain</strong> is a terrifying psychological horror game where you must survive a deadly circus performance. Waking up in an abandoned circus, you quickly realize that you have become part of a monstrous show. Every corner hides secrets, and sinister creatures are watching your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535530/extras/6195ef72446637c1f977e39a8528b93f.poster.avif?t=1765867378\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535530/extras/6195ef72446637c1f977e39a8528b93f.webm?t=1765867378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you’ll need to solve challenging puzzles, avoid deadly traps, and uncover the dark history of this cursed place. Every step could be your last, as the horrors of the circus do not forgive mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535530/extras/06f64389ee838d96daf2776c0e10f718.poster.avif?t=1765867378\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535530/extras/06f64389ee838d96daf2776c0e10f718.webm?t=1765867378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535530/extras/06f64389ee838d96daf2776c0e10f718.mp4?t=1765867378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a nightmarish atmosphere inspired by classic horror games and try to find a way out before the circus claims you forever. Are you ready to play your final role?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535530/extras/e7ec79672bb31d15997ab9c3881c5926.poster.avif?t=1765867378\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535530/extras/e7ec79672bb31d15997ab9c3881c5926.webm?t=1765867378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>                      The circus welcomes everyone… but not everyone leaves.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circus of Pain</strong> is a terrifying psychological horror game where you must survive a deadly circus performance. Waking up in an abandoned circus, you quickly realize that you have become part of a monstrous show. Every corner hides secrets, and sinister creatures are watching your every move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535530/extras/6195ef72446637c1f977e39a8528b93f.poster.avif?t=1765867378\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535530/extras/6195ef72446637c1f977e39a8528b93f.webm?t=1765867378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To escape, you’ll need to solve challenging puzzles, avoid deadly traps, and uncover the dark history of this cursed place. Every step could be your last, as the horrors of the circus do not forgive mistakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535530/extras/06f64389ee838d96daf2776c0e10f718.poster.avif?t=1765867378\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535530/extras/06f64389ee838d96daf2776c0e10f718.webm?t=1765867378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535530/extras/06f64389ee838d96daf2776c0e10f718.mp4?t=1765867378\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a nightmarish atmosphere inspired by classic horror games and try to find a way out before the circus claims you forever. Are you ready to play your final role?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535530/extras/e7ec79672bb31d15997ab9c3881c5926.poster.avif?t=1765867378\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3535530/extras/e7ec79672bb31d15997ab9c3881c5926.webm?t=1765867378\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
